## tsc errors (strict, noImplicitAny, zod 4, Node types)

scenarios/11-halts-with-a-clock.ts(63,80): error TS2345: Argument of type '(choice: DecisionChoice<{ contractId: string; category: string; draftUrl: string; summary: string; }>) => { action: string; notes: string; } | undefined' is not assignable to parameter of type '(choice: DecisionChoice<{ contractId: string; category: string; draftUrl: string; summary: string; }>) => NoInfer<{ action: "return" | "approve"; notes: string; }> | undefined'.

